 <h3><u>Ya zehra ya zehra</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Yaa Zehra&nbsp; Yaa Zehra</p> 
  <p>1.ai meri bibi&nbsp;&nbsp; x 2<br> Tere dar pe istegasa hai<br> Tera mamnoon meri shehzadi ye jaha saara hai</p> 
  <p>2.tu hame hifz aur ama dede<br> Apni chadar ka saebaan dede<br> Teri qudrat me kya nahi bibi<br> Tu jise chahe do jaha dede.</p> 
  <p>3.ai meri bibi<br> Ansuo me dua mangi hai<br> Teri tasbeeh hee padh k dilne tujhe pukara hai</p> 
  <p>4.tera darbar wo sakhi dar hai<br> Har farishta jaha gadagar hai<br> Tere makrooz aasmawale<br> Tera makrooz har sikandr hai</p> 
  <p>5.ai meri bibi<br> Ashq e gum teri amanat hai<br> Teri aulad k hee gam ne hame sawara hai</p> 
  <p>6.majlis e gum me ashq barsane<br> Aa sake yaa nahi khuda jaane<br> Kya bharosa humari sanso ka<br> Kal kaha hum kaha aza khaane</p> 
  <p>7.tujhko ummat ne yoo sataya hai<br> Marge mohsin pee bhi rulaya hai<br> Tujhko baba k baad ummat ne<br> Haaye darbar me bulaya hai</p> 
  <p>8.ai meri bibi<br> Itne sadme uthaye hai tune<br> Jeete ji tujko meri shehzadi gumne mara hai</p> 
  <p>9.Farshe majlis pe aur musalle pr<br> Har jawan keh raha hai ro-ro kar<br> Hum rahe na rahe magar bibi<br> Ta Qayamat rahe gam-e-sarwar</p> 
  <p>10.ai meri bibi<br> Bas tu hee muraad deti hai<br> Teri chaukhat dar e Elahi ka istehara hai</p> 
  <p>11.tere bachcho se jisko pyar nahi<br> Wo tere gum ka talabgaar nahi<br> Khel samjhe na wo tere gum ko<br> Ye ibadat hai karobaar nahi</p> 
  <p>12.karbala me teri shabi bankar<br> Apne baba ki zindagi bankar<br> Tera bachpan hai sakina bibi<br> Aur jawani hai Zainab e muztar</p> 
  <p>13.waqt e Akhir hai bas mera bibi<br> Anginat hai mere guna bibi<br> Wasta tujhko tere bachcho ka<br> Bakshwana mere gunaah bibi.</p> 
  <p>14.Hai yahi mazhar abedi ki dua<br> Tere bachcho ka gum rahe zinda<br> Saath irfan k rahe jari<br> Tere sadqe me karwane aza.ID...</p> 
